        <mxCell id="n91" value="&lt;b&gt;Not reachable or not used&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• DeltaDTM home repository: connection blocked, so the Earth Engine copy was used&lt;br&gt;• GEDTM30: host certificate expired (deferred)&lt;br&gt;• FathomDEM, WorldDEM Neo DTM: skipped by decision&lt;br&gt;• KLHK/BRGM: no further data or metadata obtainable" style="fontFamily=Source Sans 3;fontColor=#1F2A30;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;spacing=6;strokeWidth=1.25;fillColor=#F4F6F6;strokeColor=#B8C4C2;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
